<section class="page-hero compact"><p class="eyebrow">Product vision</p><h1>Not another wellness app.</h1><p class="lede">Chiedza is designed around continuous care, structured summarisation, state-based routing and a clinical safety spine.</p></section>
<section class="section two-col"><div><h2>The 10-layer system</h2><ol class="architecture-list"><li><strong>AI Emotional Listener</strong><span>Always-on, non-judgmental listening and signal detection.</span></li><li><strong>Care Summarisation Engine</strong><span>Structured insight instead of raw emotional chaos.</span></li><li><strong>Care Orchestrator</strong><span>Routes the user according to current state and capacity.</span></li><li><strong>Therapist System</strong><span>Human support, SOAP notes, plans, sessions and oversight.</span></li><li><strong>Matching Engine</strong><span>Clinical fit first, then safety fit, availability, language/timezone and workload.</span></li><li><strong>Longitudinal Care Memory</strong><span>Patterns, triggers, interventions and safe/unsafe states over time.</span></li><li><strong>Crisis Detection & Safeguarding</strong><span>Detection, grounding, human review and warm handover.</span></li><li><strong>User Consent & Control</strong><span>Visibility, transcript, recording and communication choices.</span></li><li><strong>Therapeutic Modes</strong><span>Stabilisation, Active Therapy, Recovery and Crisis.</span></li><li><strong>Therapist Workload Intelligence</strong><span>Prevents overload and balances care assignment.</span></li></ol></div><aside class="principles-card"><p class="eyebrow">Ethical perimeter</p><h3>What we never build</h3><ul class="plain-list"><li>Streak punishment</li><li>Public leaderboards</li><li>Scarcity timers or FOMO</li><li>Guilt notifications</li><li>Infinite feeds</li><li>Forced daily logging</li><li>Autonomous AI therapy</li><li>Unsupervised crisis response</li><li>Surveillance dressed up as insight</li></ul></aside></section>
